# ─── Coldpress runtime state ───────────────────────────────────────
# .coldpress/ holds the graph index, caches, and other machine-local
# state that Butler / Graphify create on first use. Never committed;
# never shipped with the template (dirs are lazy-materialised at
# init time, not pre-stubbed).
.coldpress/

# ─── Environment / secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────
# secure/manifest.yaml (tracked) declares expected keys by name.
# Actual secret values live in secure/.env* and are never committed.
# See docs/secure-pattern.md for the loader pattern.
secure/.env
secure/.env.*
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# ─── OS noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# ─── IDE / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─── Common ecosystem build artefacts ──────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
.turbo/
*.log
